1
00:00:00,271 --> 00:00:03,061
(Sheldon:)Does he provide her
with health insurance?

2
00:00:03,983 --> 00:00:05,273
(Leonard:)No.

3
00:00:05,443 --> 00:00:09,153
(Leonard:)Look, imagine you maintained a friendship
with someone you had sex with...

4
00:00:09,322 --> 00:00:12,162
(Leonard:)...but you were free to date
whoever you wanted.

5
00:00:13,159 --> 00:00:15,659
(Sheldon:)I'm sorry, I can't imagine any of that.

6
00:00:16,913 --> 00:00:18,543
All right, back to the game.

7
00:00:18,706 --> 00:00:19,916
(Sheldon:)I believe it's my turn.

8
00:00:20,083 --> 00:00:22,333
(Sheldon:)You may begin your questions
whenever you're ready.

9
00:00:22,502 --> 00:00:24,292
(Raj:)Are you Spock?

10
00:00:28,299 --> 00:00:30,469
(Sheldon:)I don't like this game.

11
00:00:31,677 --> 00:00:33,427
(Howard:)So where were we?

12
00:00:33,596 --> 00:00:36,766
- Aren't you leaving for your booty call?
- No, it was something else.

13
00:00:36,933 --> 00:00:39,683
(Howard:)Why does everything
have to be about sex with you? Come on.

14
00:00:39,852 --> 00:00:41,062
Whose turn is it?

15
00:00:41,229 --> 00:00:42,479
- We're up to you.
HOWARD: Great.

16
00:00:42,647 --> 00:00:44,857
(Howard:)- Just start.
- Okay, let's see.

17
00:00:45,024 --> 00:00:47,614
(Leonard:)Are you from a TV series?

18
00:00:47,777 --> 00:00:49,197
(Howard:)She dumped me.

19
00:00:50,321 --> 00:00:51,611
[CRYING]

20
00:00:52,448 --> 00:00:57,038
(Sheldon:)I bet he's someone from Babylon 5.
We're never gonna get it.

